<title>UK: Hong Kong's Mandarin interim profit rises.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong's Mandarin interim profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million $ unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (cents)		4.08		   vs 3.28</p>
<p> Dividend (cents)	 1.65		   vs 1.55</p>
<p> Pretax		     34.2		   vs 27.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   106.8		  vs 89.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Luxury hotel operator Mandarin Oriental International Ltd, which released its results in London, said it expects a &quot;satisfactory profit increase&quot; for the full year, with strong demand at its two Hong Kong hotels and improved performance in Manila &quot;set to continue.&quot;</p>
</text>
